Z||000000||bigpacupacu||10-15-2001||06:51 PM||||Just wondering if anyone's going to "dress up" for any Halloween parties. I'm 32 years old , and still like get crazy at halloween parties. I like to try and come up the most original costume. One year I dressed up as a Sperm. I wore all white with a white hood and tail, flippers and a mask. On the back of my shirt was the olympic rings with "FALOPIAN SWIM TEAM" written under them.<BR>Last year I was an escaped mental patient. I wore a hospital gown with a big fake rubber butt stickin out the back! This year I am deciding between the Witch doctor costume or dressing up as an old bag lady. Does anybody have any crazy costume ideas? <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/00_00075.1.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by bigpacupacu (edited 10-15-2001).]||||reg||1
